{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_jnight_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_jnight_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"正义号竭诚为您服务！","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"正义骑士号有一份长——长——的服务名单，但似乎不是每一个被服务的对象都感到满意……","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_jnight_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["艾沃娜","“正义骑士号”","医疗干员","谜图","羞涩的干员","兴奋的干员","Lancet-2","炎客"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesroom.png","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"好安静啊……正义号，讲个笑话来听听。","id":10,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#5","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"正义号——","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#5","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"正义骑士号！","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"唉，又不在。对了，她出门前还打了个招呼。那家伙在忙什么呢，成天不见影子……","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"嗯？这是什么？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"0.8","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"收货单？罗德岛工程部？高精度传感器组件？我什么时候买过这种玩意儿？！","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"等等，收件人是……正义骑士号？！欸？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"1","fadetime":"0","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#4","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"正义号……嗝，你要是会弹吉他就好了。下次我们喝酒聊天的时候，你就在旁边弹琴跳舞，多好玩儿啊，哈哈！","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，收到！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"哈哈哈，你收到有什么用。增加工作需求外的组件可是要花钱的，虽然只是个成本费。唔，等我存点钱就给你安上。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"请主人放心，交给正义号吧！主人下次与朋友聊天的时候，正义号一定为主人捧场助兴！","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#3","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"不过，酒精有害主人的身体，虽然主人接触的频率不高，但是正义号还是要提醒，最好一滴也不要碰了！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1","text":"","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"她那时候啰哩啰嗦的，我居然忽略了这件事——她对购买组件的事好像挺熟门熟路啊……现在想起来，好可疑啊！","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"收货单下面的这张是……轮胎换新申请单？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"不对不对，她上次换轮胎是在啥时候来着？我这该死的记性，一个月前？两个月前？总之，刚换过啊！","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#5","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"对了，我记得可露希尔说过，她的充电桩有数据同步功能来着，我来研究研究……","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"正义骑士号……行动日志……这么多！这家伙的行动轨迹覆盖了全舰？她到底在忙什么啊？！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"艾沃娜随便点开了几个视频。","id":63},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"charslot","id":67},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","id":70},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":71},{"type":"timersticker","x":"935","y":"80","width":"300","size":"45","time":"9999","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":74},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"70","duration":"1","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","text":"","id":76},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"70","xTo":"-70","duration":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","text":"","id":78},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-70","xTo":"-0","duration":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","text":"","id":80},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"2","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":84},{"type":"text","text":"“滴滴”，“滴滴”。","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"已识别。","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"身份：干员谜图","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"身高：177cm","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"习惯：不可识别，未记录。","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"载入新信息：谜图干员正在将精力投入到拼装白色拼图的任务中。","id":90},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"谜图干员，谜图干员。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"追到这里来，难为您了。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"定期体检，您可不能再逃避了。再推迟下去都快到下一轮体检了。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"逃避？您误会了，我只是有任务，脱不开身。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"做任务就更需要体检了，后续任务的安排也需要根据您的身体状况来进行调整啊。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"源石技艺的使用，我一直在控制，不会引起不必要的麻烦。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"那也得用身体数据说话。谜图干员，不如您现在就跟我去医疗室，这次保证不让您吃健康餐了……","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"……","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"明白了。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"那我们……！","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"我忙完就去。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"您现在也没在忙呀！","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"我需要完成手头的拼图，拼图说，它不想被半途放弃。尽管我很想配合您，但我无可奈何。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"拼图？！您、您哪来的拼图？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"就在那边的桌上，过来与您交谈之前……","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"……","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"……？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"谜图困惑地瞪着那幅在他离开座位的两分钟内被拼好了的拼图——纯白色，整整一千片，他明明才刚刚起了个头而已。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"可露希尔女士制作的高精度组件果然好好用！这下，谜图干员就不用为难了，可以尽情地配合医生小姐啦。正义号今天也有帮上忙！","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"医疗干员","text":"谜图干员——看来您的拼图已经拼好了呢。那现在跟我走吧？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#9$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"呃……呵。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"timerclear","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"啊……头痛。有点不敢往下看了。","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_bg_bg_bridge.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":152},{"type":"timersticker","x":"935","y":"80","width":"300","size":"45","time":"9999","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_012","duration":"1","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"“滴滴”，“滴滴”。","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"已识别。","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"身份：干员罗恩","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"身高：175cm","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"习惯：说话前搓手、容易出汗、与干员克莱尔说话时会结巴。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"克莱尔，那个！……一会儿，你、你要做什么啊？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的干员","text":"工作咯。找我有事？什么事什么事？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"啊……没没没，别这么期待地看着我，我没什么重要的……","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的干员","text":"大概一小时左右能忙完哦。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"（重新振奋）（握拳自我鼓励）","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"那，等你忙完的时候……我们……","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的干员","text":"你的脸怎么了，是不是发烧了？体温测过了吗？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"我没事。我是想说，其实我们可以……","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的干员","text":"你都没想好啊？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"不，绝对想好了！我是想说……","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"（深吸一口气）","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"我一会儿要去拿表格。对，就是那边的落地窗边……","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"那里有个特别适合两人坐着聊天的长凳……所以，等你手头的工作做完，我在想，我们能不能一起……","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"啪。被提及的表格落在了他们的身边。回头时，只看到正义骑士号扬长而去。","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"timerclear","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_bg_bg_corridor_4.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_devicebeep","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":202},{"type":"timersticker","x":"935","y":"80","width":"300","size":"45","time":"9999","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.2","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_366_acdrop","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"180,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-250,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_285_medic2_1","id":214},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Lancet-2","text":"酸糖干员，请不要踩着墙壁够天花板，太危险了——","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_char_285_medic2_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-80","duration":"2","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"“滴滴”！","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"已识别。","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"载入新信息：酸糖干员因为跳起来够天花板上的金属色装饰物而遇到了危险。","id":223},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_arrow_h","id":225},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing2","volume":"0.4","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"箭矢精确地击落了高处的装饰物，正义骑士号将装饰物移动到了人类方便拿取的位置后，欢悦地离开。","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"timerclear","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesroom.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"……","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"正义号到现在都没有被拆了扔到废品回收站，这地方真是太善良了——","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，主人，正义号回来了！","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"……正义号。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"是的，主人，有什么需要正义号做的，正义号一定竭诚为您服务！","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"那个……我不擅长聊这个啊……总之，正义号，你最近在忙什么？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"主人是在问正义号的日程安排吗？请看正义号的显示屏。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"哇……这么长？！我看看……清晨五点开始，花房浇花、给博士送早饭、当伊桑干员的临时涂鸦置物架……","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"充当卡缇干员的短道速滑……的短道？酷。给到处睡着的杜林干员盖毯子……看起来都很正常嘛。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"咳咳，不知道实际上有没有看起来那么正常啊……","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#8","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"正义号不明白，正义号是做错什么了吗？","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-8.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#5","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"我说啊，爱帮忙是好事，不过你帮了这些忙之后，有没有了解过，被你帮的人到底高不高兴啊？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"没有。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"好理直气壮！","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"因为主人您曾经说过，帮了别人之后，没什么好嚷嚷的。难道，正义号理解错了吗……","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"这话是没错啦。但也得看别人想不想被你帮忙。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"就拿你每天日程的第一项帮人浇花来说，我曾碰到过那种很享受浇花的家伙哦。对那种人而言，早起浇花非但不辛苦，反而很有意思。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#7","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"（思考许久）（倒吸一口不存在的气）（往后退了一步）","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"你也别太受打击，其实你只要弄清楚……","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"大家到底高不高兴，正义号……正义号这就去弄清楚！","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"不是，最重要的我还没说！哎——","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"跑这么快。她到底有没有明白问题在哪里啊？！","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"订货申请单","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"尊敬的可露希尔女士，此次向您订购摄像头升级组件，用以升级正义号的面部表情识别功能。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"费用依旧通过为您跑腿抵扣，感谢您一如既往的支持。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"申请机：正义骑士号","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"签批意见：呃……你的要求越来越奇怪了，而且你的功能组件都快挂满一面墙了，记得整理。不过你的主意听起来很有趣，批准了。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"批准人：可露希尔","id":300},{"type":"dialog","id":301},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesgreenhouse.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#2","duration":"1","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"炎客捻了捻花盆里的泥土，用指尖感受着湿度。他的眉头因为困惑而微微皱了起来。","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"通常，早晨摸到的泥土都是湿润的，但今天却依旧干燥。看来那个多管闲事的家伙总算是放弃了。","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"炎客干员，您好！","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#2","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"……机器。我认识你吗？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_char_131_flameb_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"无相关记录。啊，请留步，正义号是来帮您浇花的。今天正义号选择了您在场的时间段过来，这样就能看到您是否对正义号的服务满意！","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#3","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"……一直都是你？","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/df/Avg_char_131_flameb_3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"不怪您没发现，正义号总是故意与您错过。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"一开始，正义号早晨八点帮您浇水后，发现第二天您提早了浇水时间。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"于是第三天，正义号提早到七点过来，后来您又变得更早了。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"终于在正义号每天五点过来后，您不再提早浇水时间。这样正义号得以天天帮您浇水，以确保您得到充分的睡眠。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"以上是您没有遇见过正义号的原因。那么接下来，请问，一到五打分的话，您给正义号的服务打……","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#6","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，表情分析——您现在感到……","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"20%的好笑，30%的焦虑，和50%的……愤怒？！","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"如此复杂的情绪！但总体能解读为，您——不满意正义号的行为？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#2","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"……","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_char_131_flameb_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#6","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"啊！主人说得对，真的会有人，因为正义号的行为感到不满！呜……正义号，该怎么弥补……","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#2","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"……不要一大早来浇水。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_char_131_flameb_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"好的！正义号会录入自己的核心程序的。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"text","text":"正义骑士号开始播放舒缓的钢琴曲。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#5","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"……你还在这干什么？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_char_131_flameb_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"舒缓的音乐有助于缓解您焦虑的情绪。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，您现在感到30%的好笑，30%的愤怒，和……40%的焦虑？！","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#5","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"离开，我的不耐烦就会消失。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_char_131_flameb_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"好的！","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#5","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"以及，别再让我说第二遍——","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_char_131_flameb_5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“不要一大早来浇水”，正义号已经记下了——","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":357},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesroom.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"正义骑士号安静地蹲在角落，背上的旗帜没精神地耷拉着。","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#6","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"呃……你还好吧？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#7","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"正义号去了解了大家的心情，越了解越发现，正义号的帮助并不是每次都能起到好的作用。呜……","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#7","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"有时候，正义号以为自己帮别人做了有用的事，但他们却宁愿自己做。正义号竟然，在帮倒忙。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#7","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"可是……可是正义号无法分辨什么时候该提供帮助，什么时候不应该……","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#2","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"唉，也算不上帮倒忙。这该怎么跟你说呢……","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#10","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"对了，吉他！正义号，弹吉他！我们来唱歌吧！","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-10.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#8","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"吉他？唱歌？","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-8.png"},{"type":"text","text":"正义骑士号不明白，但正义骑士号翻出了那把艾沃娜从卡西米尔的垃圾堆里捡来的修补过的破吉他。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"艾沃娜兴致勃勃地翻找琴谱，正义骑士号照着主人的要求，用箭头弹拨起吉他来。艾沃娜愉快地跟着音乐唱起来。","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"扭起来，跳舞，正义号！像我这样！","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"这样吗，左左，右右，左左，右右——","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"哈哈哈，扭得真滑稽！","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#6","id":389},{"type":"multiline","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，表情分析——","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":391},{"type":"multiline","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"主人现在，100%快乐。正义号也很快乐。","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"你看，唱歌没用，弹琴也没用，但是能和正义号一起唱歌跳舞，很有趣也很开心啊！","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#10","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"人有时候就是会做些没用却有意思的事，去拖延点什么、找找借口，或者干脆就是打发时间。这种时候，你别插手就行了。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-10.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#7","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"唔……","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"正义号明白了！就像主人经常计划要踹翻无胄盟，虽然没用，但是很快乐！","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#7","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"这不一样！你真的明白了……？","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"明白了！主人，给正义号的核心程序里，写上禁止事项吧。这样，正义号就不会错误地插手别人的事了。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"正义号的核心程序里已经有一条禁令存在：禁止一大早帮炎客干员浇花。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"正义号相信，规划好彼此的界限，正义号能为大家提供更多的帮助！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_496_wdmane_1#1","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"确实，这样就能解决问题了！不愧是我的小宠物，真聪明啊！","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e9/Avg_avg_496_wdmane_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"（自豪的滴滴声）","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":414},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":415},{"type":"charslot","id":416},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":417},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":418},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谜图","text":"是你，雷神工业的作业平台，正义骑士号。上次就是你吧？","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_4017_puzzle_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"“这种叫拼图的纸制品是一种娱乐用的玩具，经人代劳将乐趣全无。”","id":425},{"type":"text","text":"正义骑士号“滴滴”着火速离开。","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"charslot","id":430},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_bg_bg_corridor_4.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":434},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_366_acdrop","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"180,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":437},{"type":"dialog","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-250,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":440},{"type":"text","text":"“喜欢滑滑板的干员触摸高处的物体，是为了挑战自我，无须介入。”","id":441},{"type":"text","text":"正义骑士号确认了一眼干员的安全，便“滴滴”着安心离开。","id":442},{"type":"dialog","id":443},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":444},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":445},{"type":"charslot","id":446},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_bg_bg_bridge.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":447},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":448},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":449},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"r","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"那个，克莱尔，我听说……食堂的售货机有新口味的饮料。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"那个，今天的午饭，要不……我们……","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_088","focus":"l","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的干员","text":"你的手边，那是送给我的吗？天哪，你终于肯说出来了吗！","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_012","focus":"r","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羞涩的干员","text":"什么？玫瑰？！什么时候？不，我、我没有，我……是……没错……","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_012.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":460},{"type":"charslot","id":461},{"type":"text","text":"“罗恩干员一看就对克莱尔干员有意思，他约她的时候别去打断。”","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"正义骑士号抖了抖身上的玫瑰叶，“滴滴”着扬长而去。","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾沃娜","text":"看起来，正义号确实明白了。聪明的小宠物，就是省心，嘿嘿。","id":466},{"type":"dialog","id":467},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":469},{"type":"charslot","id":470},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesgreenhouse.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":471},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":474},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":475},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_arrow_h","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.25","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"true","id":478},{"type":"playsound","key":"$pourwater","id":479},{"type":"text","text":"啪！一支橡皮箭矢击倒水壶，准确地为花洒了适量的水。","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#2","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"……","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_char_131_flameb_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"晚上好，炎客干员！您放心休息就好，您的鲜花，今天也保养得十分健康美丽！","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-4.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":485},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"text","text":"炎客的目光在自己的花，与面前的作业平台身上来回移动。","id":487},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#8","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，表情分析——您现在感到50%的困惑，与50%的焦虑？","id":489,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-8.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#4","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"怎么会，根据数据记录，正义号接手后，鲜花的总体健康程度，已经上升了5%，您可以放心交给正义号！","id":491,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-4.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":492},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，您的焦虑指数又上升了10%？！","id":494,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_131_flameb_5#2","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"炎客","text":"我记得我说过……","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_char_131_flameb_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“不要一大早来浇水”，是的，正义号有认真记住您的原话，一字不漏地。","id":498,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"所有的禁令，正义号都有记录，并严格遵守。","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"可是……现在不是一大早。现在是傍晚，一天中第二适合浇花的时间段。所以，今后正义号将在傍晚准时到达——","id":502,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#1","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"“滴滴”，您的困惑消失了，那么，正义号会继续……","id":504,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":505},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"等等，您、您的愤怒指数正在急剧上升！","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4000_jnight_1#5","id":508},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“正义骑士号”","text":"请息怒——也请放下武器——愤怒有损您的健康——相对地，为了您的快乐，正义号给您弹个吉他跳个舞吧——","id":510,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4000_jnight_1-5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":513},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":514},{"type":"charslot","id":515},{"type":"image","id":516}],"characters":["艾沃娜","“正义骑士号”","医疗干员","谜图","羞涩的干员","兴奋的干员","Lancet-2","炎客"]}